    - target: {fileID: 8661493747195580245, guid: 6bda7e57e2f54f776a189a4629aa088a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Dialouge_0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8680529628964073724, guid: 6bda7e57e2f54f776a189a4629aa088a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8680529628964073724, guid: 6bda7e57e2f54f776a189a4629aa088a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Great, now for the second phase of the simulation, find the data shard.
        Follow the yellow lights.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8680529628964073724, guid: 6bda7e57e2f54f776a189a4629aa088a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Obviously the real hiest won't have those light's, don't forget this
        is just a simulation kid. I'm just trying to help you out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8680529628964073724, guid: 6bda7e57e2f54f776a189a4629aa088a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Navigate through the lab and look for the data shard . Trust me you
        won't miss it, you know why....
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8680529628964073724, guid: 6bda7e57e2f54f776a189a4629aa088a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: BECAUSE IT'S A BIG FLOATING DATA SHARD!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8680529628964073724, guid: 6bda7e57e2f54f776a189a4629aa088a, type: 3}
